;	MODULES AFFECTED: COMMON
;	EDIT TYPE: ENHANCEMENT
;	ADD THE FOLLOWING MONITOR COMMANDS:
;	TELL, MESSAG, WHO (FOR MESSAGE SYSTEM FROM U. OF ILLINOIS);
;	CONNEC (TO RUN CONNEC BY DIRECT COMMAND);
