>
	EXP	0		;(127) OBSOLETE
HNGLST::XWD	0,0		;(130)LH IS ADDRESS OF FIRST DEVICE WHICH SHOULD BE
				; CHECKED TO SEE IF IT IS HUNG
EXP	BOOTXT			;(131) ADDRESS OF RELOAD CCL TEXT
IFG TAPN,<
